  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the kitchen of Claude Monet, cooks Senya and Fedya casually debate the pros and cons of guest chef Elena Sokolova's polite management style. Their peaceful conversation is abruptly shattered when Chef Viktor Barinov storms in on crutches, furious and demanding absolute obedience. Let's listen to their sudden kitchen encounter in Russian.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Ну, как тебе новый шеф-повар?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Она кажется мне немного скучной.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Зато она спокойная и вежливая.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Это правда, она никогда не кричит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "С ней на кухне тихо и приятно.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Бездельники! Огрызки! Что вы делаете?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я вернулся навести полный порядок!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Шеф, мы просто чистили рыбу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Мы очень рады видеть вас!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Прекратите болтать и берите ножи!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Кто разрешил вам стоять без дела?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Мы сейчас всё нарежем, шеф.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Быстро за работу, живо!",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Let's explore how Senya and Fedya's casual discussion of management styles is violently disrupted by Chef Barinov.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "senya",
      "t": "Зато она спокойная и вежливая.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'On the other hand she is calm and polite.' Senya admits that working without constant screaming is a nice change of pace.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "fedya",
      "t": "Это правда, она никогда не кричит.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is true, she never yells.' Fedya agrees, relaxing into the surprisingly peaceful kitchen atmosphere.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Я вернулся навести полный порядок!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I returned to restore complete order!' The illusion of peace shatters as Chef Barinov bursts in, determined to reclaim his territory.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Прекратите болтать и берите ножи!",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop chatting and take your knives!' He immediately barks direct orders to remind everyone who is really in charge. Now let's listen to the whole conversation again from start to finish.",
